1
00:00:00,813 --> 00:00:02,813
(gasps)
Good idea.

2
00:00:04,616 --> 00:00:06,516
(Sheldon:)And since you've had
such a rough day,

3
00:00:06,519 --> 00:00:09,689
(Sheldon:)I'm gonna let you throw
the pie in Leonard's face.

4
00:00:16,228 --> 00:00:17,798
(Raj:)Thank you for forgiving me.

5
00:00:17,797 --> 00:00:19,227
(Amy:)It's okay.

6
00:00:19,232 --> 00:00:22,202
(Emily:)At some point, we were bound
to have our first fight.

7
00:00:22,201 --> 00:00:24,201
(Raj:)Well, it almost happened
when you called

8
00:00:24,203 --> 00:00:26,273
my apple pie crust "doughy."

9
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,240
(Raj:)The truth is
you were right.

10
00:00:30,243 --> 00:00:32,973
(Raj:)And I was just
angry at myself.

11
00:00:32,979 --> 00:00:36,149
(Emily:)Can I ask you one thing?

12
00:00:36,149 --> 00:00:37,519
(Raj:)Of course. What?

13
00:00:37,517 --> 00:00:40,147
(Emily:)Did you look in my closet?

14
00:00:40,153 --> 00:00:42,483
(Raj:)No. Just the drawer.

15
00:00:42,488 --> 00:00:44,188
(Emily:)You promise you didn't
look in the closet?

16
00:00:44,190 --> 00:00:45,220
(Raj:)I promise.

17
00:00:45,224 --> 00:00:46,594
(Raj:)Why, what's in there?

18
00:00:46,592 --> 00:00:48,692
(Emily:)Don't worry about it.

19
00:00:48,694 --> 00:00:50,024
(Emily:)Good night.

